WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:54.360
Come on Harper I need to finish teaching you how to use the equipment.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.380
That's your job. I'm just here for the astrological benefits.

00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:59.380
That's not a thing

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:05.600
Just hurry up. We need to get moving and we're going to miss the meteor shower.

00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.280
Dude, chill.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:13.200
Come on. You're gonna get left behind.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.480
Shoot, was that you?

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:28.460
Does it look like it was me?

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:31.500
It was probably just a bug bite or something.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:02.600
Careful.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:07.320
Are you guys going in there?

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:10.080
Uhhh yeah, why?

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.480
Don't stay too long after dark and don't stray from the trail.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.880
Skinwalkers will come for you.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.160
You mean like ghosts?!

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:20.090
Skinwalkers!

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:22.080
They roam here.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:25.800
Right well, we're in a hurry, but thanks for the warning...

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.540
If you draw a circle with arrows pointing inwards--

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.920
We'll keep that in mind. Thanks for the advice, but we really need to go.

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:35.460
Take this!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:37.980
Just in case.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:39.880
Thank you!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:52.860
HARPER: Is this the right way?

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:54.360
RILEY: Look.

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.740
It should be here.

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:26.800
Riley?

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:29.620
Riley...?

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:33.400
Riley!!?

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:38.100
Oh my gosh....

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:39.420
Riley...

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:47.860
Thank you for watching Skinwalker. If you enjoyed this film, please give this video a like.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.860
Also, let me know in the comments

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:56.220
what legends you'd like to see us cover in future videos. A lot of weird stuff happened during the production of this film.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.779
Eventually I'm going to do a True Fear episode

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:05.950
documenting it, and when I do I'll drop you a link right here. Until then check out my other horror films it this playlists and

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:14.520
subscribe to CZsWorld for new horrors every week, ring that death bell for notifications, and I'll see you in the next one.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:17.080
Assuming we both survive.

